  "name": "Book One: The Red Supremacy: Chapter 3 - Good News For Bad People",
  "synopsis": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "ACT I: THE RED SUPREMACY"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "With the heroes lost, the world’s fate lies in the hands of the vilest syndicate known to man."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Scarlet Witch is forced to join Dr. Doom, the man who unleashed her power to cause M-Day, or she will watch those she loves most die."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The return of one of the Marvel Universe’s great villains!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "An Avenger quits, a heart is broken, and the world as we know it is gone."
    }
  ],
